<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;">One more touch before we can approve it</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Thanks for shipping <strong><%= @values[:project] %></strong>. It needs one more touch before we can approve it:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:10px 14px;background:#f4f1ea;border-radius:8px;"><%= @values[:reason] %></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Fix it up and ship again whenever you're ready.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0;"><a href="<%= @values[:link] %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#a8481a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;">Ship it again</a></p>
<%= render "footer" %>
